w: 1.~Christ the Lord is risen to- day, _ Al- _ _ _ _ le- _ lu- _ ia!
w: 2.~Love’s re- deem- ing work is done, _ Al- _ _ _ _ le- _ lu- _ ia!
w: 3.~Vain the stone, the watch, the seal, _ Al- _ _ _ _ le- _ lu- _ ia!
w: 4.~Lives a- gain our glor- ious king, _ Al- _ _ _ _ le- _ lu- _ ia!
w: 5.~Soar we now, where Christ has led, _ Al- _ _ _ _ le- _ lu- _ ia!
w: 6.~What tho’ once we pe- rished all, _ Al- _ _ _ _ le- _ lu- _ ia!
w: 7.~Ris’n with Him, we up- ward move, _ Al- _ _ _ _ le- _ lu- _ ia!
w: 8.~Scarce on earth a thought be- stow, _ Al- _ _ _ _ le- _ lu- _ ia!
w: 9.~Hid till Christ our life ap- pear, _ Al- _ _ _ _ le- _ lu- _ ia!
w: 10.~Hail the Lord of earth and Heaven, _ Al- _ _ _ _ le- _ lu- _ ia!
w: 11.~King of Glo- ry, Soul of Bliss, _ Al- _ _ _ _ le- _ lu- _ ia!
